---
description: Rules for spec-driven artifacts in .specs (TLC + phase runner)
globs: .specs/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Follow `.claude/skills/tlc-spec-driven/SKILL.md` and `.claude/skills/d2rmm-phase-runner/SKILL.md`.
- Never write an `**Approved**:` line the maintainer did not give. Under a phase delegation, quote the kickoff words
  verbatim and append `(delegated via .specs/phases/F<n>/brief.md)`.
- Assumed decisions: `### AD-NNN — … (assumed)` in STATE.md and a row in the phase `decisions.md`.
- Run `validate_spec.py` / `validate_tasks.py` and `pnpm specs:check` after edits.
